&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qui sommes-nous ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fondée en 2014, Artefact est une société internationale de services autour de l&#39;IA et de la data, spécialisée dans le conseil en IA, transformation data et en data &amp;amp; digital marketing. L’approche unique d’Artefact, qui fait le pont entre la donnée et le business, permet à nos clients d’atteindre leurs objectifs business de façon dédiée et efficace. Nos 2500 collaborateurs répartis dans 27 bureaux à travers le monde allient leurs compétences pluridisciplinaires au profit de l’innovation business des entreprises.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;La mission des Artefactors ?&lt;/strong&gt; Transformer la data de nos clients en impact business. Dans ce sens, nous collaborons avec plus de 1000 clients, leaders de leurs industries (Orange, Carrefour, Samsung, AccorHotels, L’Oréal, LVMH, Decathlon) et sommes partenaires privilégiés de Google (GMP/GCP), AWS ainsi que Microsoft Azure.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;En tant que stagiaire Software Engineer, tu seras ammener à:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participer activement à la conception et à l&#39;implémentation de solutions techniques robustes et scalables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architecture logicielle :&lt;/strong&gt; Contribuer à la réflexion sur l&#39;architecture de nos applications, en veillant à la performance et à la maintenabilité du code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Déploiement et opérations (DevOps) :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; automatisation des tests et des déploiements cloud avec des pipelines CI/CD et une infrastructure en tant que code (ex : Terraform), packaging d&#39;applications dans des conteneurs (ex : Docker), implémentation d&#39;outils d&#39;observabilité des données (ex : DBT)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Déploiement de ton logiciel sur le cloud&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;: GCP, AWS ou Azure&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Déploiement d’une ou plusieurs expertises techniques suivantes&lt;/strong&gt; : développement logiciel, ingénierie analytique, ingénierie ML, architecture cloud ou ingénierie de sécurité et de fiabilité des sites&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Veille technologique :&lt;/strong&gt; Explorer de nouvelles technologies et outils pour optimiser nos méthodes de travail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profil recherché&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Formation :&lt;/strong&gt; Tu es étudiant(e) en dernière année de cycle ingénieur, Master 2, ou équivalent, avec une spécialisation en sotware engineering, génie logiciel, informatique, ou développement web et tu recherches ton stage de fin d’études à partir de Janvier 2027&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compétences techniques :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maîtrise d&#39;un ou plusieurs langages de programmation&lt;/strong&gt; comme Python, Java, JavaScript (Node.js), Go ou Scala.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connaissance des principes de la programmation orientée objet et/ou de la programmation fonctionnelle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expérience avec des bases de données SQL ou NoSQL.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une familiarité avec le &lt;strong&gt;Cloud (GCP, AWS, Azure)&lt;/strong&gt; et les conteneurs (Docker, Kubernetes) est un atout.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connaissance des outils de versioning, en particulier &lt;strong&gt;Git&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualités personnelles :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Curiosité et proactivité :&lt;/strong&gt; Tu as envie d&#39;apprendre et de proposer de nouvelles idées.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rigueur et souci du détail :&lt;/strong&gt; Tu es soucieux(se) de produire un code propre et de qualité.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Esprit d&#39;équipe :&lt;/strong&gt; Tu es capable de travailler en collaboration et d&#39;échanger avec des profils variés (Data Scientists, Consultants, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Français courant pour travailler en équipe et anglais professionnel obligatoire pour nos clients internationaux&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Le processus de recrutement &lt;/strong&gt;: pour rejoindre Artefact, nous te proposons un processus de recrutement en quatre étapes durant lequel tu auras l’occasion de parler de ton expérience et d&#39;en apprendre davantage sur Artefact et le poste d&#39;ingénieur logiciel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entretien RH&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entretien #1 – Test de codage avec un Senior Software Engineer&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entretien #2 - Test d&#39;architecture et de pipeline avec un Senior Software Engineer&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entretien #3 - Entretien de motivation avec un Manager ou Directeur du pôle Data Engineering&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Processus d&#39;onboarding :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;L&#39;intégration comprend une formation sur des compétences transversales critiques telles que la gestion du temps, la communication orale et écrite. Un counsellor te sera également attribué qui te guidera dans ta familiarisation avec la culture et les méthodes de travail de l&#39;entreprise. De plus, tu auras l&#39;opportunité de travailler sur des projets internes pour acquérir une expérience pratique et perfectionner tes compétences. De plus, tu auras la possibilité d&#39;obtenir des certifications sur les fournisseurs cloud avant de travailler sur des missions clients. Ce processus d&#39;intégration est conçu pour te doter des connaissances et des compétences nécessaires pour devenir un ingénieur logiciel performant chez Artefact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ce que nous offrons&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un stage de &lt;strong&gt;6 mois&lt;/strong&gt; basé à &lt;strong&gt;Paris&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un environnement de travail stimulant, où tu seras encouragé(e) à prendre des initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un accompagnement par un mentor expérimenté pour te faire progresser rapidement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;L&#39;opportunité de travailler sur des projets variés et complexes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;La possibilité d&#39;être embauché(e) en CDI à la fin du stage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prêt à rejoindre l&#39;aventure ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Si tu te reconnais dans cette description et que tu souhaites mettre tes compétences au service de projets concrets et impactants, envoie-nous ta candidature !&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Chez Artefact, nous recrutons nos collaborateurs uniquement en fonction de nos besoins et des qualités propres de chaque candidat. Nous assurons le développement de leurs compétences professionnelles et de leurs responsabilités sans discrimination d’aucune sorte. Le groupe s&#39;engage à reconnaître et promouvoir tous les talents, quels que soient leurs croyances, âge, handicap, parentalité, origine ethnique, nationalité, identité de genre, orientation sexuelle, appartenance à une organisation politique, religieuse, syndicale ou à une minorité, ou toute autre caractéristique qui pourrait faire l&#39;objet d&#39;une discrimination.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qui sommes-nous ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact est une société de conseil et d&#39;ingénierie française spécialisée en data et IA, et leader en Europe, qui depuis plus de 10 ans est spécialisée dans la conception et le déploiement de technologies d’intelligence artificielle et de solutions data-driven. Basé à Paris, nous sommes aujourd’hui présents dans 27 pays sur tous les continents et comptons 2500 collaborateurs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notre mission est d’aider les entreprises à exploiter tout le potentiel de l’IA et de la data en développant des solutions sur-mesure adaptées à leurs enjeux métiers. En tant que pionniers dans ce domaine, nous allions expertise technologique et excellence opérationnelle, en collaborant avec les plus grands acteurs du marché. Nos clients couvrent tous les secteurs clés de l’économie – industrie, retail, luxe, grande consommation, santé, finance – et incluent des grands groupes internationaux.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En tant que &lt;strong&gt;Stagiaire Data Consultant&lt;/strong&gt;, tu seras pleinement intégré(e) à une équipe de consultants. Ton rôle sera d&#39;assister nos clients dans l&#39;élaboration et la mise en œuvre de leur stratégie data, de la phase d&#39;idéation jusqu&#39;à l&#39;implémentation. Tes missions pourront inclure :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cadrage / gestion des projets : &lt;/strong&gt;interview clients et partenaires, mise en place de workshops, préparation des uses cases…&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Construction de roadmaps, d’analyses data-driven avec l’équipe projet&lt;/strong&gt; et conception d&#39;infrastructures en collaboration avec nos experts&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Orchestration du bon déroulement du projet, en appliquant le cas échéant les méthodes agiles (sprints planning et reviews, backlog refinement, démos…)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Veille technologique et sectorielle :&lt;/strong&gt; rester à l&#39;affût des dernières tendances en matière de data et d&#39;intelligence artificielle pour proposer des solutions innovantes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication :&lt;/strong&gt; Préparer des présentations et des supports de communication pour les comités de direction et les équipes clientes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Processus de recrutement&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Étape 1 &lt;/strong&gt;: Entretien RH avec notre chargée de recrutement, Anouk. Le but de cet entretien est de faire votre connaissance, de nous parler de vos expériences professionnelles, vos envies et d&#39;en savoir plus sur votre intérêt pour le conseil et Artefact (45 minutes)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Étape 2&lt;/strong&gt; : entretien de type business case avec un &lt;strong&gt;senior&lt;/strong&gt; Data Consultant. Le but de cet entretien est de tester vos méthodes et capacités déductives, votre capacité à résoudre un problème et de confirmer votre intérêt pour Artefact (1 heure)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Étape 3&lt;/strong&gt; : deuxième entretien de type business case avec un &lt;strong&gt;manager&lt;/strong&gt; Data Consultant. Le but de cet entretien est de tester vos méthodes et capacités déductives, votre capacité à résoudre un problème et de confirmer votre intérêt pour Artefact (1 heure)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profil recherché&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Formation :&lt;/strong&gt; tu es étudiant(e) en dernière année de cycle ingénieur ou au sein d&#39;une grand école de commerce avec une spécialisation en Data, Conseil, ou Management de l&#39;Innovation et tu recherches ton stage de fin d&#39;études &lt;strong&gt;à partir de Janvier 2027&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compétences :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fort intérêt pour la Data Science&lt;/strong&gt; et les technologies de la donnée. Tu n&#39;es pas nécessairement un(e) expert(e) technique, mais tu comprends les concepts clés de l&#39;IA, du machine learning, de la Business Intelligence, et du Big Data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellentes &lt;strong&gt;compétences analytiques&lt;/strong&gt; et de synthèse.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maîtrise avancée de la suite Microsoft Office (en particulier PowerPoint et Excel).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une connaissance de SQL/Python ou d&#39;un outil de visualisation de données (Power BI, Tableau) est un plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualités personnelles :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sens de la communication et du relationnel :&lt;/strong&gt; Tu es capable de t&#39;exprimer clairement et de t&#39;adapter à différents interlocuteurs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proactivité et autonomie :&lt;/strong&gt; Tu es force de proposition et prends des initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rigueur et organisation :&lt;/strong&gt; Tu es capable de gérer plusieurs tâches et de respecter les délais.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Français courant pour travailler en équipe et anglais professionnel obligatoire pour nos clients internationaux&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ce que nous offrons&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un stage de 6 mois basé à Paris.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un environnement de travail stimulant au sein d&#39;une équipe dynamique et experte.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;L&#39;opportunité de travailler sur des projets concrets avec des entreprises de premier plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;La possibilité d&#39;être embauché(e) en CDI à la fin du stage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Si tu es passionné(e) par la data et que tu souhaites développer une double compétence en conseil et en technologie, envoie-nous ta candidature !&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Chez Artefact, nous recrutons nos collaborateurs uniquement en fonction de nos besoins et des qualités propres de chaque candidat. Nous assurons le développement de leurs compétences professionnelles et de leurs responsabilités sans discrimination d’aucune sorte. Le groupe s&#39;engage à reconnaître et promouvoir tous les talents, quels que soient leurs croyances, âge, handicap, parentalité, origine ethnique, nationalité, identité de genre, orientation sexuelle, appartenance à une organisation politique, religieuse, syndicale ou à une minorité, ou toute autre caractéristique qui pourrait faire l&#39;objet d&#39;une discrimination.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI&#39;s operational blind spots into operational clarity. World&#39;s leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there&#39;s a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Celonis Services is the delivery engine of our Celonis Customer Organization, responsible for turning the Celonis platform into measurable, business-critical outcomes for our customers. In the AI era, our role has elevated: as AI agents like our own Apollo take on more of the technical build, our people focus on the work that drives real impact—understanding our customers&#39; business-critical problems, designing the solutions that solve them, and quantifying the value delivered. Our Deployment Engineers and Deployment Architects pair deep domain and industry expertise with serious platform mastery and AI-augmented delivery, directing agentic systems while owning the judgment, architecture, and customer relationships that AI cannot replace. We deliver faster and smarter than ever, and we own the outcome: initial value realization, adoption, and the long-term success of our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Lead Deployment Architect, you are the technical authority for our strategic accounts within Celonis delivery. You shape how Celonis solutions are designed, architected, and delivered across your portfolio of strategic customer engagements. You define what good delivery looks like - setting architectural standards, designing end-to-end solution strategies, and ensuring that AI-augmented and agentic workflows are deployed effectively at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You operate at the intersection of deep platform expertise, domain knowledge, and customer strategy. You are equally comfortable leading a technical design review with Celonis engineers and presenting a transformation roadmap to a customer’s C-suite. You bridge the gap between pre-sales and post-sales, ensuring that what was promised can be delivered - and often shaping the promise itself.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role carries significant organizational leverage. You set delivery patterns that other teams follow. You define how AI agents should be orchestrated for complex, multi-workstream engagements. You work in close collaboration with Deployment Engineers and raise the bar for the entire practice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Work You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solution Architecture &amp;amp; Design&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Services scoping in pre-sales, ensuring the right Services are positioned in line with the Celonis solution architecture proposed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design end-to-end Celonis solution architectures for complex enterprise deployments, spanning multiple process areas, business units, and geographies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the technical blueprint for how the Celonis platform integrates with customer systems, data strategies, and transformation goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designing secure, scalable architectures tailored to complex enterprise requirements, optimizing for long-term usage growth and high concurrency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make architectural trade-off decisions: build vs. configure, custom vs. standard, phased vs. big-bang - with clear rationale tied to customer outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own solution quality &amp;amp; outcome delivery across engagements, conducting design reviews, and ensuring delivery teams follow architectural standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Orchestration &amp;amp; Delivery Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design how AI deployment agents (Apollo) should be used across complex, multi-workstream engagements, defining agent workflows, validation checkpoints, and quality gates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop reusable specifications, templates, and patterns that enable Deployment Engineers to direct AI agents more effectively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pioneer new delivery approaches that leverage AI to compress timelines, improve quality, or unlock use cases that were previously impractical&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set standards for AI output validation, ensuring the organization maintains quality as delivery accelerates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Strategy &amp;amp; Advisory&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the senior technical advisor to strategic customers, building trusted relationships with VP and C-level stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate customer business challenges into Celonis platform strategies, identifying high-impact use cases and defining success metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support pre-sales by providing technical credibility in complex deals, validating solution feasibility, and shaping project scope&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide customers through their Process Intelligence maturity journey, advising on platform expansion, AI readiness, and organizational change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage the broader ecosystem of Celonis experts to remove potential blockers in customer engagements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish deep, technical advisor relationships with customer stakeholders (Lead Data Engineers and Architects, Head of Data Intelligence, Head of Business Transformation) to provide technical reassurance and maintain &quot;Expert-to-Expert&quot; alignment during the course of the deployment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Successful Implementation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work together with Deployment Engineers on delivery projects to implement the most complex and cutting edge use cases for our customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay on top of the newest technologies Celonis has to offer and own the implementation of early stage products for our customers, ensuring close feedback cycles with Product &amp;amp; Engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review Solution(s) Blueprint to ensure quality, scalability and production readiness of business critical and operational use cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain &amp;amp; Industry Depth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain deep expertise in one or more process domains (e.g., Supply Chain, Order to Cash, Procure to Pay, IT Service Management) or industry verticals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate domain knowledge into scalable solution patterns, reference architectures, and best practices that the broader team can leverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify and standardize high-value use cases within your domain in collaboration with the Deployment Engineer, collaborating with Product and Business Apps teams to shape the platform roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Practice Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to hiring: define what great looks like for the Deployment job family, conduct interviews, and calibrate candidate assessments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share knowledge across the organization through internal enablement sessions, documentation, and community of practice leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the link with Product &amp;amp; Engineering to feed customer insights and field experience back into platform development, and to influence the platform roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Distinguishes This Role from Deployment Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scope: You work across multiple engagements and shape solutions across a portfolio/cluster/industry vertical (4+ concurrent clients)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence &amp;amp; Practice Development: your Scope allows you to identify and set standards that other teams follow - for solution architecture, AI orchestration patterns, and delivery quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bridge: You span pre-sales and post-sales, ensuring continuity between what’s sold and what’s delivered&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Force multiplier: Your work multiplies the effectiveness of Deployment Engineers rather than substituting for it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Qualifications You Need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience: &lt;/strong&gt;8+ years in technical consulting, solution architecture, or delivery leadership within enterprise software, consulting firms, or system integrators. At least 3 years in a senior or lead technical role with multi-stakeholder responsibility in large-scale projects at tier-1 organizations (e.g. digital twin implementations, global AI transformations, near-real-time data pipelines, etc.)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architecture skills: &lt;/strong&gt;Proven ability to design complex, multi-component solutions that span data integration, process intelligence, automation, and AI, while remaining grounded in the “so-what” of a customer’s process. Deep understanding of enterprise architecture patterns and trade-offs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI &amp;amp; agent orchestration: &lt;/strong&gt;Demonstrated ability to design AI-augmented delivery workflows leveraging frontier tooling (e.g., Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, etc.). Experience with context engineering, multi-agent system design, or AI validation at scale. Ability to define how AI should be used, not just use it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain expertise: &lt;/strong&gt;Deep knowledge in at least one major process domain or industry vertical. Ability to translate domain expertise into scalable solution patterns and credible customer advisory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer executive presence: &lt;/strong&gt;Track record of building trusted advisor relationships with VP and C-level stakeholders. Ability to present transformation strategies, defend architectural decisions, and navigate complex organizational dynamics. Demonstrated experience navigating complex IT landscapes and communicating technical trade-offs to senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform mastery: &lt;/strong&gt;Expert-level knowledge of the Celonis platform, including the Process Intelligence Graph, data modeling, advanced PQL, automation and orchestration engine, and AI modules. Ability to push the platform’s boundaries via a working knowledge of Python.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consulting &amp;amp; communication: &lt;/strong&gt;Exceptional ability to translate between technical and business audiences. Experience leading workshops, design sessions, and strategic reviews with senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; mentoring: &lt;/strong&gt;Demonstrated ability to raise the performance of teams around you. Experience mentoring technical staff, setting quality standards, and contributing to organizational capability development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education: &lt;/strong&gt;Bachelor’s or Master’s in Computer Science, Engineering, Technology Management, Business Informatics, or a comparable field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages: &lt;/strong&gt;Fluency in English and German required.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Celonis can offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Pioneer Innovation:&lt;/span&gt; Work with the global leader in Process Mining and the Process Intelligence Graph to shape the future of AI-driven business operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Ownership from Day 1:&lt;/span&gt; Every full-time &quot;Celonaut&quot; is an owner, receiving Restricted Stock Units (RSUs) and merit-based refresh grants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Unrivaled Family Support:&lt;/span&gt; Benefit from our inclusive parental leave policy—24 weeks of fully paid leave for primary carers and 12 weeks for supporting carers, available from your first day of employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Work-Life Integration:&lt;/span&gt; Enjoy Unlimited PTO (in applicable regions) and generous PTO globally, as well as a flexible hybrid work model that balances remote focus with vibrant office collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Continuous Growth:&lt;/span&gt; Elevate your skills through our 70-20-10 learning framework, mentorship programs, and access to a dedicated learning platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Holistic Well-being:&lt;/span&gt; Prioritize your health with subsidized Wellhub memberships, mental health counseling, and dedicated &quot;Wellness Weeks&quot; that prioritize work/life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Drive Sustainability:&lt;/span&gt; Participate in annual Impact Days, where you receive paid time off to volunteer for community and environmental causes with your local office, or virtually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Global Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/span&gt; Find community through our Inclusion Think Tank and participate in our annual Inclusion Days, ensuring every voice is heard and valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Value-Driven Impact:&lt;/span&gt; Join a mission-led organization where our core values—Live for Customer Value, The Best Team Wins, We Own It, and Earth Is Our Future—drive every decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI, empowering organizations to analyze, design, and operate AI-driven processes. The Celonis Platform is powered by the Celonis Context Model, which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence to create a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can understand — turning AI’s operational blind spots into operational clarity. Industry-leading companies around the world trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. Celonis is headquartered in Munich, Germany, and New York City, USA, with more than 20 offices worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1982&quot;&gt;Get familiar with the Celonis Process Intelligence Platform by watching this &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _2rkolb4i _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YR5oRJGhJYg&amp;amp;list=PLuVor-ZUD4pnM6G33C5D0tjXUvlTPYBRe&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;video&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celonis Inclusion Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Celonis, we believe our people make us who we are and that “The Best Team Wins”. We know that the best teams are made up of people who bring different perspectives to the table. And when everyone feels included, able to speak up and knows their voice is heard - that&#39;s when creativity and innovation happen.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Privacy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Any information you submit to Celonis as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Celonis’ &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/candidate-notices&quot;&gt;Accessibility and Candidate Notices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting this application, you confirm that you agree to the storing and processing of your personal data by Celonis as described in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice for the Application and Hiring Process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of Artificial Intelligence Tools&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We rely on an artificial intelligence tool to match the information from your resume to the relevant Celonis job descriptions. This processing is limited to the information provided in your resume or in your candidate profile. The tool produces a match score per candidate for a role, suggests preliminary ranking, and provides recommendations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The tool is only used for support in parts of the job application process, including to facilitate the identification of the relevant Celonis Jobs for candidates and recruiters. All final decisions are made by hiring managers and the Celonis talent acquisition team. Hiring managers and HR specialists use this tool responsibly, are aware of the risk of potential bias, and are equipped to mitigate it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware of common job offer scams, impersonators and frauds. Learn more &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/fraud-alert/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h1&gt;Senior Forward Deployed Engineer&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Forward Deployed Software Engineer &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;On-Site:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Grafenwohr, Germany – &lt;strong&gt;ACTIVE TS/SCI Clearance required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Reports to:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Echo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Direct reports:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; None. Delta’s provide performance feedback on other engineers and participate in company peer mentorship program.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Travel:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; 0-10%&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At PVM, we serve those who serve, as a Palantir ally for mission impact. We are a veteran-founded, Palantir Vanguard partner — and the only small business providing services in that tier. We help&amp;nbsp;our government partners tackle real problems in National Security, Readiness, and Space — not building shelfware.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job__description body&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Forward Deployed Engineer (FDE), you will build analytical dashboard features, support CI/CD pipeline tasks, and work within a structured agile environment alongside senior engineers and government stakeholders. You will operate in two-week sprint cycles, contributing to feature delivery from design through deployment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At our organization, an FDE takes ownership of their work — building reliable features, writing meaningful code, and ensuring each sprint increment is production-ready.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and deliver front-end analytical dashboard views using Foundry’s Workshop/Slate application layer under guidance from senior engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support CI/CD pipeline configuration tasks, including build scripts, automated tests, and environment promotion workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement metric definitions and data transformations aligned to the Foundry Ontology to ensure consistent data interpretation across dashboards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce clear technical documentation, including configuration notes, runbooks, and sprint artifacts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in sprint planning, daily standups, sprint reviews, and demonstrations for government stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct testing and validation to confirm dashboards function correctly and data aligns with approved definitions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify integration issues, surface blockers early, and collaborate with senior engineers to resolve them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support defect resolution and incremental enhancements to maintain stable operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:540,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:270,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;12&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Deep expertise with Palantir Foundry Ontology Manager, Workshop, Actions, Pipeline Builder, and operational application development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of software engineering experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Python, TypeScript, or Java in cloud-based data platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in government, defense, or classified environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to independently build features, test them, and deliver production-ready functionality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working in small, fast-moving technical teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:540,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:270,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;17&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Experience conducting ontology reviews, governance assessments, and platform architecture evaluations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About PVM &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At PVM, we mean it when we say we value diversity. As a PVM team member, you will work with people from all different backgrounds that are passionate about the problems we solve for our customers and are focused on delivering value for our clients. Our culture encourages problem solving, leadership, and innovation, and creates an environment that will support your professional and personal growth. Here are a few highlights of the advantages of being a part of the PVM community:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities for growth and advancement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tuition/Training reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Peer bonus program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remote and on-site positions available&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited PTO&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible work schedule&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;PVM delivers digital services that help government agencies unlock the power of their data for good and maximize the value of their technology investments. We design, develop, and deploy solutions to solve mission-critical problems. PVM is a black- and service-disabled veteran-owned small business and was founded by a retired Naval officer out of frustration with the status quo with one goal in mind: to help his fellow Shipmates solve the problems they were facing every day. Today, we continue to be driven by that same goal and are focused on taking on our clients’ missions as our own to make a difference in the communities we serve. PVM believes in equal opportunity employment. We won&#39;t discriminate against any employee or applicant based on race, gender, nationality, age, religion, disability, military status, or sexual orientation. As a company and as individuals, we&#39;re committed to providing an inclusive and welcoming environment for our team, our family members, and our clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-alert job-alert--margin&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;PVM, Inc. is an SBA 8(a)-certified, Service-Disabled Veteran-Owned Small Business and Palantir USG Vanguard Partner. PVM is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Your IMC journey begins with a three-week Global Trainee Program led by our seasoned engineers and traders, during which you’ll link up with graduates from all IMC regions: Europe, the United States, India and Asia-Pacific. During this traineeship, you’ll learn more about IMC, the basics of trading and options theory. Training continues back at your local office, where you’ll receive support from a dedicated mentor. As a Graduate Risk Analyst, you operate at the beating heart of our business: in the dealing room of IMC’s Amsterdam office. Your work supports IMC’s critical day-to-day risk management activities, including the monitoring and analysis of our markets, as well as our credit, liquidity, and operational risks. What happens next is up to you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR CORE RESPONSIBILTIES &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become an expert in options, financial markets, and how IMC applies algorithmic trading as a market maker&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the ongoing development of IMC’s proprietary risk management systems, together with our Engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse developments in the markets in which we trade and identify risks and opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be an integral part of your team by advising on limit requests, monitoring intraday and overnight risks, and discussing key exposures with our trading desks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR SKILLS AND EXPERIENCES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recent or upcoming graduates seeking to join IMC full-time in February 2027&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An academic background in Mathematics, Physics and/or Econometrics or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in a programming language is preferred (Python, MATLAB or R)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;First-class analytical skills and a desire to solve complicated problems creatively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine interest in financial markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note: If you have already applied for this position during the current recruitment season and were not selected, you may reapply when the next recruitment season begins in Summer 2027. We encourage you to focus on enhancing your skillset before reapplying.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Due to current U.S. immigration and visa restrictions, some candidates may not be eligible to obtain the U.S. business visa required as part of our Global Traineeship Programme. As the programme includes mandatory training in the United States shortly after joining, we are unfortunately unable to proceed with applications from candidates who are unable to obtain the required visa within the programme timeline.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;If you are a dual passport holder of another nationality or a European citizen who wants to relocate back to Europe, you remain welcome to apply and should inform our campus recruitment team of your situation:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ---------- class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;IMC is a research-driven trading firm where quantitative modeling, machine learning, and engineering shape how modern markets are traded. A stabilizing force in markets since 1989, we provide liquidity across trading venues, delivering the best outcome in value and risk management to investors. Using our own technology and capital, we build proprietary systems and algorithms that operate across global markets. Our researchers, traders, and engineers work as a collective, combining rapid experimentation, advanced infrastructure, and real-time feedback to turn insight into execution and execution into advantage.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI&#39;s operational blind spots into operational clarity. World&#39;s leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there&#39;s a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Intern in Technology &amp;amp; Management Consulting you join our Value Engineering team to focus on driving and closing opportunities by identifying and selling the value Celonis can bring to customers. Our Value Engineers (VE) are the trusted advisor for customers and work on the intersection of technology and business. Value Engineers partner with sales and customers to create compelling solutions to critical business problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Value Engineers are the trusted advisors for our prospects and customers and leverage product expertise and business acumen to solve our prospects’ and customers’ most pressing challenges You will gain experience in executing proof of value projects and take part in technical/business discussions with stakeholders. By creating customer-based business cases, you support the strategic business development activities for the &lt;strong&gt;French market&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The work you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze data from our customers to increase transparency in business processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand the pain points of our customers and translate them into actionable use cases in the Celonis Process Intelligence Platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quantify financial impact of use cases implemented in the Celonis Process Intelligence Platform and prepare management ready presentations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present findings together with your team in front of customers’ C-level and decision makers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage Celonis data modeling and AI capabilities to uncover process inefficiencies, generate insights, and deliver high impact, data driven value propositions to clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pitch the Celonis AI value proposition and vision to customers and align our solutions with their AI strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong relationships with our customers by winning their trust through technical, product expertise, and business acumen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The qualifications you need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Student in the field of Technology &amp;amp; Management, Industrial/ Business Engineering, Business Informatics, Business Administration, Computer Science, Mathematics, Economics or a comparable degree program.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and interest in interacting with potential customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in consulting and highly interested in data analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge in SQL or related database query languages&lt;/li&gt;
